    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your foe’s shot fractures your scapula, either cracking the shoulder blade or snapping one of the protruding bony processes that are part of the shoulder joint. Sure sucks to be your arm right now!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (2) and suffer a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.4lj1ik958mbgAlaF]{Broken Bone (Minor)}.</p><p>Extraction will require <strong>Surgery (Challenging)</strong> as the arrowhead has lodged in bone.</p>"
